{"symbol":"GARGI","yahoo":"GARGI.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"PNGS Gargi Fashion Jewellery Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Luxury Goods","website":"https://www.gargibypng.com","about":"PNGS Gargi Fashion Jewellery Limited engages in the trading of fashion and costume jewellery, articles of silver, and other articles in India. It offers certified sterling silver jewellery, brass and copper jewellery, idols, and other gift articles. The company's products include earrings, necklaces, pendants, chains, finger rings, bracelets, anklets, nose pins, mangal sutras, pendant sets, and bangles for females of various age groups; and male accessories, such as rings, cufflinks, and button sets, as well as idols and other silverware and related gift items. The company operates through point of sales counters and brand store franchises. PNGS Gargi Fashion Jewellery Limited was founded in 1832 and is based in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:23:36+00:00","quote":{"price":614.3,"prevClose":628.75,"marketCap":643.17,"high52":1197.0,"low52":532.15,"pe":20.66,"bookValue":135.53,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":1.047,"insiders":74.21,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2022-12-20","2022-12-21","2022-12-22","2022-12-23","2022-12-26","2022-12-27","2022-12-28","2022-12-29","2022-12-30","2023-01-02","2023-01-03","2023-01-04","2023-01-05","2023-01-06","2023-01-09","2023-01-10","2023-01-11","2023-01-12","2023-01-13","2023-01-16","2023-01-17","2023-01-18","2023-01-19","2023-01-20","2023-01-23","2023-01-24","2023-01-25","2023-01-27","2023-01-30","2023-01-31","2023-02-01","2023-02-02","2023-02-03","2023-02-06","2023-02-07","2023-02-08","2023-02-09","2023-02-10","2023-02-13","2023-02-14","2023-02-15","2023-02-16","2023-02-17","2023-02-20","2023-02-21","2023-02-22","2023-02-23","2023-02-24","2023-02-27","2023-02-28","2023-03-01","2023-03-02","2023-03-03","2023-03-06","2023-03-08","2023-03-09","2023-03-10","2023-03-13","2023-03-14","2023-03-15","2023-03-16","